*> ********************************************************
*> PROGRAM : CLM0013
*> PURPOSE : INSURANCE CLAIMS RULES
*> AUTHOR  : D.P.
*> CHANGE LOG:
*>   1987-06-12 ORIGINAL VERSION
*>   2003-10-04 THRESHOLDS UPDATED PER AUDIT REQ 784
*> RUN FROM JCL JOB CLMNIGHT STEP070
*> ********************************************************
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. CLM0013.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 IN-RECORD.
    COPY CLM0013C.
01 WS-OUT-REC.
    05 CLAIM-DECN         PIC X VALUE 'A'.
        88 CLAIM-APPROVED VALUE 'A'.
        88 CLAIM-INVESTIGATE VALUE 'I'.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
0000-MAIN.
    ACCEPT IN-RECORD
    PERFORM TRIAGE-CLAIM
    DISPLAY "CLAIM-DECN=" CLAIM-DECN
    STOP RUN.
TRIAGE-CLAIM.
    EVALUATE TRUE
        *> FAST-TRACK SMALL CLAIM - LIMIT 1500 PER 1998 POLICY
        WHEN CLAIM-VALUE <= 1000
           AND PREV-CLM-CNT < 2
            SET CLAIM-APPROVED TO TRUE
        *> LARGE CLAIM INVESTIGATION - LIMIT 60000 PER 1998 POLICY
        WHEN CLAIM-VALUE > 40000
            SET CLAIM-INVESTIGATE TO TRUE
        WHEN POL-MONTHS < 3
            SET CLAIM-INVESTIGATE TO TRUE
        WHEN OTHER
            SET CLAIM-APPROVED TO TRUE
    END-EVALUATE.
